From bd59c4b900c14701e46a419cd8b973a8a4b26a5b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 20:17:55 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] launcher: gather installed apps in an Apps folder

With the multi-link experiment, the launcher lists the built-in apps
and an Apps row right after Settings; the row opens a list of the
installed apps sorted by name. The row is hidden while no app is
installed. After an app launched from the folder exits, the launcher
opens the folder again.

The order set in the phone app still applies to the built-in apps.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
